    <div class="container" style="max-width:860px">
      <p class="intro-p">Roatán is one of the most accessible Caribbean markets for U.S. buyers — but the legal framework, process, and due diligence look different than they do at home. This guide answers the most common questions Americans ask before buying property in the Bay Islands of Honduras.</p>
      <p class="intro-byline">Reviewed May 2026 by Tomás Figueroa, The Agency Roatán.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

